    "“Everything” shows the episodes of the playlists that are on. An episode stays as long as one of its playlists is on. Hidden playlists start off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "„Alles“ zeigt die Folgen der eingeschalteten Playlists. Eine Folge bleibt drin, solange eine ihrer Playlists an ist. Ausgeblendete Playlists sind zunächst aus."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Everything” shows the episodes of the playlists that are on. An episode stays as long as one of its playlists is on. Hidden playlists start off."
          }
        }
      }
    }
